---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Build your stickers"
description: "Pick a size and quantity, upload your artwork and see your price instantly. Custom die-cut stickers from 50 units."
nav: shop
permalink: /shop/
scripts: ["/assets/js/shop.js"]
---
<section class="shop">
    <div class="shop-head">
      <h1 class="mega split rv" aria-label="Build your stickers">
        <span class="line" aria-hidden="true"><span>Build your</span></span>
        <span class="line" aria-hidden="true"><span>stickers</span></span>
      </h1>
      <p class="lede fade rv" style="--i:2">Pick a size, pick how many, upload your art. The price updates as you go.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="builder">
      <div class="board-wrap fade rv" style="--i:2">
        <div class="board" id="board">
          <div class="stack" id="stack">
            <span class="dim"><b id="dimLabel">7.5 cm</b></span>
            <span class="dim dim-v"><b id="dimLabelV">7.5 cm</b></span>
            <img src="/assets/img/cactus.svg" class="ghost" style="--g:5" alt="">
            <img src="/assets/img/cactus.svg" class="ghost" style="--g:4" alt="">
            <img src="/assets/img/cactus.svg" class="ghost" style="--g:3" alt="">
            <img src="/assets/img/cactus.svg" class="ghost" style="--g:2" alt="">
            <img src="/assets/img/cactus.svg" class="ghost" style="--g:1" alt="">
            <img src="/assets/img/cactus.svg" class="main" id="previewArt" alt="Preview of your sticker">
          </div>
          <span class="ruler" id="rulerLabel">7.5 cm longest side</span>
        </div>
        <p class="board-note" id="boardNote"></p>
        <p class="board-note proof-note">This is a rough preview. We'll email you an exact proof showing the cut line before anything prints.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="config fade rv" style="--i:3">
        <fieldset>
          <legend>1. Size <small>(width × height in cm)</small></legend>
          <p class="field-hint">Choose the size that matches the <strong>longest side</strong> of your artwork. We scale your design to fit, so a design that's 10 cm wide and 6 cm tall goes in the 10 × 10 option.</p>
          <div class="opts" id="sizeOpts"></div>
        </fieldset>
        <fieldset>
          <legend>2. Quantity</legend>
          <div class="qty-row"><select id="qtySelect" class="qty-select" aria-label="Quantity"></select></div>
          <div class="chips" id="qtyQuick" aria-label="Popular quantities"></div>
          <p class="field-hint more-qty">Need more than 5,000? <a href="/contact/?topic=bulk">Get in touch</a> for a custom quote.</p>
        </fieldset>
        <fieldset>
          <legend>3. Artwork</legend>
          <label class="drop" id="drop">
            <input type="file" id="file" accept=".pdf,.ai,.eps,.svg,.png,.jpg,.jpeg,.tif,.tiff">
            <strong id="dropText">Drop your artwork here, or tap to choose a file</strong>
            <small>PDF, AI, EPS, SVG, PNG, JPG or TIFF, up to 50MB</small>
            <span class="upload-progress" id="uploadProgress" hidden><span></span></span>
          </label>
        </fieldset>
        <fieldset>
          <legend>4. Border colour</legend>
          <p class="field-hint">The thin edge around your design, where we cut. Pick whichever suits your artwork. The preview updates as you choose.</p>
          <div class="opts edge-opts">
            <label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="edge" value="white" checked><span class="opt-face"><i class="swatch" style="background:#fff"></i><strong>White</strong></span></label>
            <label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="edge" value="black"><span class="opt-face"><i class="swatch" style="background:#000"></i><strong>Black</strong></span></label>
          </div>
        </fieldset>
        <div class="summary" aria-live="polite">
          <span class="sum-size" id="summarySize"></span>
          <div class="price-line"><span class="total" id="total">$0.00</span><span class="per" id="per"></span></div>
          <span class="save" id="save"></span>
          <button class="btn btn-block magnetic" id="addToCart" type="button">Add to cart</button>
          <p class="form-error" id="cartError" role="alert" hidden></p>
          <p class="added-msg" id="addedMsg" role="status" hidden>Added to your cart! Set up your next design above, or <a href="/cart/">go to your cart</a> to check out.</p>
          <a href="/cart/" class="btn btn-ghost btn-block" id="goCart" hidden>View cart</a>
          <p class="fine">All prices in AUD.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <section class="faq" aria-labelledby="faqTitle">
      <h2 class="sec-title" id="faqTitle">Good questions</h2>
      <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">What's a die-cut sticker?<span class="pm" aria-hidden="true"></span></button><div class="faq-a"><div><p>A sticker cut around the outline of your design, so there's no square background. Just your artwork with a thin border.</p></div></div></div>
      <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">How long will my order take?<span class="pm" aria-hidden="true"></span></button><div class="faq-a"><div><p>Orders are printed and shipped within 3 business days of you approving your online proof, and every order is sent by Express shipping for a flat $13. See our <a href="/shipping-returns/">shipping and returns policy</a> for delivery details.</p></div></div></div>
      <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">Are your stickers weatherproof?<span class="pm" aria-hidden="true"></span></button><div class="faq-a"><div><p>Yes. Every sticker is made with outdoor signage-grade materials and inks, so they're fully waterproof and handle rain and snow with no trouble. They're UV protected too, so your design will keep looking great for 3-5 years.</p></div></div></div>
      <div class="faq-item" id="artwork-requirements"><button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">What are your artwork requirements?<span class="pm" aria-hidden="true"></span></button><div class="faq-a"><div><p><strong>Vector artwork:</strong> PDF, AI or EPS files, with your fonts converted to outlines.</p><p><strong>Image artwork:</strong> JPEG, PNG or TIFF files, at 300 dpi at full size.</p><p>CMYK files are preferred, but we also accept RGB. Just note that some colours can shift slightly when RGB artwork is printed.</p></div></div></div>
      <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">What if my artwork isn't print-ready?<span class="pm" aria-hidden="true"></span></button><div class="faq-a"><div><p>No stress. We can get your artwork ready for print for you, including adding bleed, cut paths and outlines.</p><p>If your file is too low resolution to print crisply, we'll reach out and ask for a sharper version. We can also tidy up or redraw artwork if it needs it, though an artwork fee usually applies.</p><p>Whichever way it goes, you'll get a proof to approve before anything is printed. Check our <a href="#artwork-requirements" data-open-faq>artwork requirements</a> to see which files work best.</p></div></div></div>
      <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">Can I order more than one design?<span class="pm" aria-hidden="true"></span></button><div class="faq-a"><div><p>Yes! Set up your first design and add it to your cart, then build the next one. Each design can have its own size, quantity and border colour, and you check out once for the whole order.</p></div></div></div>
    </section>
  </section>
<script type="application/json" id="pricing-data">{{ pricing | dump | safe }}</script>
